# OpenSpec

Follow the global OpenSpec workflow for this project. Treat `openspec/specs/`
and `openspec/changes/` as the source of truth, and use the generated
`.cursor/commands/opsx-*.md` commands for OpenSpec work.

Every change says how we sell it, and the marketing site (`seeka-marketing/`)
updates in the same release as the feature. The rules live in
`openspec/config.yaml`.
